1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,030
Woman: Are we still meeting at the museum this afternoon for the exhibit?

2
00:00:07,030 --> 00:00:11,180
Man: Yes, definitely. But I'm running a bit behind.

3
00:00:11,180 --> 00:00:14,220
I had to finish up a paper for my history seminar

4
00:00:14,220 --> 00:00:17,010
And it took longer than I expected.

5
00:00:17,010 --> 00:00:20,190
Woman: No worries. I'll head over and wait for you in the lobby.

6
00:00:20,190 --> 00:00:23,080
The exhibit doesn't close until 6, right?

7
00:00:23,080 --> 00:00:28,250
Man: That's right. I should be there in about 20 minutes. Thanks for being flexible.

8
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:32,169
Woman: Of course, I've been looking forward to this exhibit all week.
